00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Drinking wild muddy water will cause lethal diarrhea within 3 days! Here is how to purify it without plastic!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Hardwood charcoal, Clean rinsed river sand, Small round pebbles

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Step 1: Set up a 3-stick tripod and mount the cone funnel

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Step 2: Crush charcoal to pea size and pack an 8cm active bed

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Step 3: Layer clean rinsed river sand to a flat 6cm barrier

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Fatal Mistake: Drinking filtered clear water without thermal boiling

